+### PT1. Network badge: the switch works, and the logo shows (HOME-14, HOME-13)
+
+**Why.** The Settings switch "Network icons on posters" writes `ui.networkBadges`, but `PosterCard` never reads it. iOS
+reads it at `Features/HomeView.swift:952`. iOS draws the TMDB network logo top-leading, not the name bottom-start
+(`HomeView.swift:995-1001`).
+
+**Files.** `home/PosterCard.kt` only.
+
+**Steps.**
+1. In `PosterCard`, read the preference the same way the other screens read theirs:
+   `val showNetwork = rememberPref(env.data.prefs, PrefKeys.UI_NETWORK_BADGES) { it.bool(PrefKeys.UI_NETWORK_BADGES, true) }`.
+   Check that `rememberPref` is imported in `PosterCard.kt`; if it is not, add the import from the same package the other
+   home files use.
+2. In the `LaunchedEffect(item.id)` (line 68), add `showNetwork` as a condition, so the TMDB network call is not made when
+   the switch is off. Key the effect on `showNetwork` as well as `item.id`.
+3. Wrap the badge block (`network?.let { net -> ... }`, lines 116 to 125) in `if (showNetwork)`.
+4. Logo. The network object is `NetworkBadge` (`model/TmdbModels.kt:132`), with `name` and `logo: String?`. When `logo`
+   is not null, draw `RemoteImage(logo, ...)` in a white 92% rounded plate, top-start, with 6 dp padding (4 dp when the
+   poster is narrower than 115 dp). Plate size: 34 × 14 dp, or 24 × 10 dp when narrow (`HomeView.swift:996-1001`). Check
+   the `RemoteImage` parameters first (`net/RemoteImage*.kt`, VERIFY); if it cannot take a plate, use a `Box` with the
+   background and put the image inside.
+5. When `logo` is null, keep the existing name label, but move it to top-start with the same plate rules.
+
+**Desktop effect.** The switch starts to work on desktop too. The badge moves to top-start and shows the logo on desktop.
+
+**Acceptance.** Switch off: no badge, and no network request for posters (check the call is skipped). Switch on: logo
+shows for titles that have one; name shows for the rest.
+
+**Stop if** `RemoteImage` cannot be placed on a plate without a signature change. Report it; do not change the signature.
+
